 "differences": [
  "The published paper (J Exp Psychol Learn Mem Cogn, 2026) could not be read; the participant checks use the bioRxiv preprint (Methods) and the authors' code documentation. The preprint's percent changes in average vowel spacing were not recomputed because the authors' spacing function is not in their public code. The preprint gives 14 speakers in each of three age bands (42), but 41 speakers were kept and the shared file has 13 aged 56 or over (one older participant was excluded)."
